OL,3,AKing and Queen to visit the Caribbean
OL,4,Ain autumn tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla will
OL,7,Ftravel to the Caribbean later this
OL,8,Fyear, Buckingham Palace has announced.
OL,10,FThe royal pair will travel to Antigua
OL,11,Fand Barbuda for the Commonwealth Heads
OL,12,Fof Government meeting, with the King
OL,13,Falso visiting the Bahamas and Guyana as
OL,14,Fpart of the eight-day trip.
OL,16,FThe tour - planned for 27 October to 4
OL,17,FNovember - will "celebrate the
OL,18,Fcommunities, cultures and nature within
OL,19,Fthe Commonwealth family," the palace
OL,20,Fsaid on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
