OL,3,AKing and Queen to visit the Caribbean
OL,4,Ain autumn tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt marks the first time the King has
OL,7,Fvisited the Caribbean since 2021, when
OL,8,Fhe travelled to Barbados to see the
OL,9,Fcountry officially removed Queen
OL,10,FElizabeth II as its head of state and
OL,11,Fbecome the world's newest republic.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
